WEBVTT

01:35.979 --> 01:38.220
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.479 --> 01:41.229
[Episode 11]

02:02.200 --> 02:03.120
When did you learn to...

02:03.120 --> 02:04.040
Hush.

02:07.650 --> 02:08.380
Draw a card.

02:16.870 --> 02:18.000
What does this mean?

02:20.360 --> 02:21.840
The Wheel of Fortune.

02:26.290 --> 02:28.210
Your Mr. Right has appeared.

02:29.560 --> 02:30.820
He's someone near you.

02:38.650 --> 02:40.710
[Hailan University]

02:38.730 --> 02:41.740
Xiaole, Ning and I
got into Hailan University as we wished.

02:40.810 --> 02:43.340
♪ She left in spring ♪

02:41.840 --> 02:43.579
Xiaole joined the photography club

02:43.579 --> 02:46.610
and instantly became
the new prince charming on campus.

02:44.170 --> 02:47.090
♪ Gone with her was cherry blossoms ♪

02:46.390 --> 02:48.410
[Welcome, freshmen]

02:46.770 --> 02:49.120
Ning and Chen Fan
started a campus romance.

02:47.770 --> 02:50.329
♪ On the once youthful face ♪

02:49.150 --> 02:51.910
But Ning is so busy practicing the cello
every day that she has no time for dates.

02:51.410 --> 02:54.040
♪ I can't help but think of her ♪

02:51.970 --> 02:54.790
Zhao Zhenghao went to college
in another city. As for Mengmeng,

02:54.790 --> 02:58.350
she blossomed as college began
and fit right in.

02:54.970 --> 02:57.260
♪ She left in spring ♪

02:58.410 --> 03:02.600
We all finally started the college life
we had always dreamed of.

02:58.440 --> 03:00.850
♪ All was like a dream ♪

03:01.830 --> 03:04.410
♪ Youth never lasts ♪

03:05.870 --> 03:08.430
♪ Just let her go ♪

03:08.360 --> 03:09.290
Look over there.

03:09.490 --> 03:11.720
♪ The paper plane that was once set free ♪

03:11.900 --> 03:15.270
♪ Will find its way back
to the old desk and chair at school ♪

03:15.310 --> 03:17.680
Okay. Lift up your head a bit.

03:15.500 --> 03:18.550
♪ All stories have yet to end ♪

03:18.800 --> 03:20.150
That's right.

03:25.840 --> 03:26.700
A little lower.

03:26.710 --> 03:28.210
Mengmeng!

03:28.240 --> 03:29.030
Lan!

03:29.510 --> 03:31.190
Look at your new haircut.

03:31.240 --> 03:32.470
So pretty.

03:32.470 --> 03:33.840
I used a curly iron.

03:33.840 --> 03:34.520
I'll fix your hair next time.

03:34.520 --> 03:34.840
Great!

03:34.840 --> 03:36.340
Why is Ning absent again?

03:36.470 --> 03:38.360
Is she having another practice session?

03:38.360 --> 03:39.470
She's working too hard.

03:39.470 --> 03:41.030
I should practice the cello too.

03:41.030 --> 03:41.680
Ning isn't here.

03:41.680 --> 03:44.010
So you got all dressed up for nothing,
huh?

03:44.030 --> 03:44.750
Wait.

03:44.800 --> 03:45.840
You're in a blue shirt,

03:45.840 --> 03:46.520
and...

03:46.520 --> 03:47.360
deep blue pants.

03:47.360 --> 03:48.190
A lovely match

03:48.190 --> 03:49.840
with a dash of red as decoration.

03:49.840 --> 03:50.770
Well, you must be

03:51.079 --> 03:52.010
up to something.

03:52.079 --> 03:53.079
Up to what?

03:53.630 --> 03:55.560
You should spend this time with Ning

03:55.560 --> 03:57.760
instead of gossiping, don't you think?

03:59.079 --> 03:59.850
Oh right.

04:01.080 --> 04:04.340
There will be an event in your university
this Saturday...

04:05.720 --> 04:07.240
[Freshman Dance]

04:07.360 --> 04:08.490
The Freshman Dance.

04:08.800 --> 04:10.190
My girlfriend Ning will perform

04:10.190 --> 04:11.580
the opening number

04:11.630 --> 04:13.290
as a freshman representative.

04:13.290 --> 04:15.420
This is a tradition of our university.

04:16.510 --> 04:18.550
But the rule of the dance says

04:18.579 --> 04:21.480
each participant must bring
a partner of the opposite gender.

04:21.480 --> 04:22.360
This is clearly

04:22.360 --> 04:23.810
a mixer, isn't it?

04:24.240 --> 04:25.070
Your university

04:25.070 --> 04:27.630
is just too...

04:28.040 --> 04:30.500
focused on social events
and not academics.

04:31.190 --> 04:32.360
But as I heard,

04:32.360 --> 04:35.360
we can invite those from other colleges
to this dance.

04:35.800 --> 04:38.530
Didn't your sweetheart Luo Ningzi
tell you that?

04:40.560 --> 04:42.070
Ning has been busy since college started.

04:42.070 --> 04:44.510
She hasn't told me about the dance yet.

04:44.870 --> 04:46.000
You little wimp.

04:46.420 --> 04:49.020
I just wasted my time
getting you all dolled up.

04:49.070 --> 04:51.070
Ning's probably busy practicing the cello.

04:51.070 --> 04:52.000
I need to go practice too.

04:52.000 --> 04:52.560
Time to take off.

04:52.560 --> 04:53.020
Bye bye!

05:09.990 --> 05:12.270
[The school piano is broken again]

05:15.360 --> 05:16.160
Professor Ye,

05:16.750 --> 05:18.310
I wonder if I can ask you a question.

05:18.310 --> 05:19.870
Do you have time now?

05:22.310 --> 05:23.440
Let's talk outside.

05:29.190 --> 05:30.870
Only one student can receive

05:30.870 --> 05:32.310
the full scholarship every year.

05:32.310 --> 05:34.370
I'll send you the information later.

05:35.240 --> 05:36.050
Professor Ye,

05:36.190 --> 05:38.050
I'll possibly be chosen, won't I?

05:38.070 --> 05:39.950
Academic performance
is not the only criteria.

05:39.950 --> 05:42.210
The evaluation covers many other areas.

05:42.310 --> 05:43.190
I think you should attend

05:43.190 --> 05:44.430
more extracurricular activities

05:44.430 --> 05:45.490
in your spare time.

05:46.310 --> 05:46.750
Got it.

05:50.040 --> 05:53.240
You've been absent-minded
in the cello practice lately.

05:53.240 --> 05:55.000
Did something happen at home?

05:57.310 --> 05:58.770
I'll get myself together.

05:59.310 --> 06:01.510
If you have encountered difficulties,

06:01.800 --> 06:02.730
just let me know.

06:03.190 --> 06:04.850
I'll help you find a solution.

06:05.750 --> 06:07.010
Thanks, Professor Ye.

06:07.190 --> 06:08.360
I think I can manage.

06:12.000 --> 06:13.430
You're remarkably gifted,

06:13.430 --> 06:15.560
with the potential of being a cellist.

06:16.360 --> 06:17.690
Do cherish your talent.

06:20.070 --> 06:20.360
Yes.

06:36.550 --> 06:37.090
Ning,

06:37.600 --> 06:38.730
I finally found you.

06:38.750 --> 06:39.680
I went to the practice room for you,

06:39.680 --> 06:41.240
but a classmate of yours said
you were in the library.

06:41.240 --> 06:42.180
So I came here.

06:42.720 --> 06:43.780
I brought you food.

06:45.680 --> 06:46.950
Don't you have a class to attend?

06:46.950 --> 06:48.870
It won't begin in another hour.

06:49.159 --> 06:51.159
You didn't reply my messages,

06:51.159 --> 06:52.159
so I came find you.

06:53.720 --> 06:54.870
I've been occupied lately,

06:54.870 --> 06:56.000
and my phone's always on mute.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.750
Maybe I didn't notice your texts.

06:57.750 --> 06:58.630
It's okay.

06:59.680 --> 07:01.010
I'm having a class soon.

07:01.750 --> 07:02.280
Oh right.

07:03.120 --> 07:05.560
There's a freshman dance on our campus
this Saturday.

07:05.560 --> 07:06.680
Would you be my partner?

07:06.680 --> 07:07.310
Sure.

07:08.630 --> 07:09.390
I'd love to.

07:10.310 --> 07:10.840
Let's go.

07:17.000 --> 07:18.510
I'm feeling great...

07:26.740 --> 07:28.110
Hey, nice kick.

07:29.430 --> 07:30.040
Shan!

07:30.190 --> 07:30.870
Shan!

07:30.870 --> 07:32.070
What brings you here?

07:32.159 --> 07:34.070
-I asked Shan to come over.
-What's up? How may I help?

07:34.070 --> 07:35.190
What is so important

07:35.190 --> 07:36.510
that you couldn't say on the phone?

07:36.510 --> 07:37.350
Shan,

07:37.560 --> 07:38.820
will you do me a favour?

07:38.950 --> 07:41.210
There's freshman dance tomorrow night.

07:41.310 --> 07:43.370
Entries must be mixed-gender pairs.

07:43.380 --> 07:44.110
Could you...

07:44.159 --> 07:45.090
be my date for it?

07:47.000 --> 07:48.120
Then what about Xiaole?

07:48.120 --> 07:48.560
He...

07:48.909 --> 07:50.360
He's adored by many girls.

07:50.360 --> 07:52.890
I'd hate to be the envy of every girl
on campus.

07:53.560 --> 07:54.060
Okay.

07:54.190 --> 07:55.240
On one condition, though.

07:55.240 --> 07:57.750
You must buy me
the most expansive beverage here.

07:57.750 --> 07:58.409
No problem!

07:58.560 --> 07:59.090
Let's go.

08:01.120 --> 08:01.580
Sure!

08:10.560 --> 08:13.490
I didn't expect you'd hide such a secret
deep inside.

08:15.070 --> 08:15.630
What?

08:16.660 --> 08:19.090
If you invite me to the dance,

08:19.120 --> 08:21.510
I'll help you find out if Lan is into you.

08:22.750 --> 08:24.080
Stop talking nonsense.

08:26.950 --> 08:28.750
Why do you want to go to
our school's freshman dance?

08:28.750 --> 08:30.350
Will you bring me to it or not?

08:30.630 --> 08:31.290
No, I won't.

08:34.309 --> 08:34.809
Fine.

08:42.240 --> 08:43.530
It's a deal now.

08:44.200 --> 08:45.790
Lan!

08:46.670 --> 08:49.200
-What is it?
-I'll attend the freshman dance too!

08:49.200 --> 08:50.320
Really?

08:53.200 --> 08:55.550
I'm spinning and dancing.

08:57.600 --> 08:59.080
Let me do the spin.

09:01.980 --> 09:03.590
[To the future we go,
with you in my youth]

09:12.960 --> 09:15.620
When did Shan learn to dance?

09:15.720 --> 09:16.530
I have no idea.

09:16.880 --> 09:19.920
[To the future we go,
with you in my youth]

09:43.670 --> 09:45.910
[To the future we go,
with you in my youth]

09:47.950 --> 09:49.990
[To the future we go,
with you in my youth]

10:15.800 --> 10:17.280
[To the future we go,
with you in my youth]

10:21.040 --> 10:28.980
[To the future we go,
with you in my youth]

10:24.840 --> 10:29.030
Let's thank these three handsome lads
for their wonderful performance!

10:30.910 --> 10:31.840
Next,

10:32.080 --> 10:33.720
let's welcome...

10:33.720 --> 10:35.550
the freshman representative
of the cello major,

10:35.550 --> 10:36.600
Ms. Luo Ningzi.

10:36.670 --> 10:39.200
She will treat us to a cello solo!

10:39.150 --> 10:43.260
[Hailan University Freshmen Dance]

10:39.200 --> 10:40.260
Let's welcome her!

10:58.700 --> 11:01.540
[Hailan University Freshmen Dance]

11:57.710 --> 12:03.030
[Hailan University Freshmen Dance]

12:14.840 --> 12:16.080
Again, let's thank

12:16.200 --> 12:17.200
Ms. Luo Ningzi

12:17.320 --> 12:19.600
for such a beautiful cello solo!

12:22.270 --> 12:23.550
Our next performer

12:23.670 --> 12:26.910
is the freshman representative
of the Department of Photography,

12:26.910 --> 12:27.960
Mr. Tong Xiaole.

12:28.550 --> 12:29.610
Let's welcome him!

12:30.200 --> 12:32.390
-You're stunning!
-Stunning!

12:33.440 --> 12:35.700
Senior, I didn't prepare a performance.

12:37.840 --> 12:39.390
I believe it's known to all of us

12:39.390 --> 12:40.360
that Mr. Tong Xiaole

12:40.360 --> 12:42.750
got higher grades than any other freshman

12:43.030 --> 12:44.320
this year,

12:44.480 --> 12:46.670
and that he chose the photography major.

12:46.670 --> 12:48.080
We are all curious.

12:48.390 --> 12:50.390
Did you choose Hailan University

12:50.790 --> 12:52.390
for a special reason?

12:57.080 --> 12:58.680
There was no special reason.

12:58.790 --> 13:00.720
Was it because of your girlfriend?

13:03.960 --> 13:05.960
We are all wondering about that.

13:06.200 --> 13:08.060
Xiaole, do you have a girlfriend?

13:08.670 --> 13:10.600
Sorry to disappoint you.

13:10.910 --> 13:12.370
I don't have a girlfriend.

13:18.440 --> 13:20.720
But there is indeed a girl in my heart.

13:21.910 --> 13:22.720
Who is she?

13:23.150 --> 13:25.320
He was into a girl in high school.

13:25.670 --> 13:27.720
Who was that girl?

13:27.790 --> 13:28.540
I don't know.

13:28.670 --> 13:30.270
Alright. That was only a joke.

13:30.270 --> 13:33.060
Here comes the last show.

13:33.270 --> 13:37.320
Let's give a warm welcome
to the seniors of the dance major

13:37.480 --> 13:38.200
and their performance!

13:38.200 --> 13:41.320
After that,
you'll have some free time to yourselves!

13:51.080 --> 13:53.960
Good for you, for having a secret crush!

13:54.200 --> 13:54.720
Shh.

13:56.670 --> 13:58.090
I bet she'll be shocked

13:58.200 --> 13:59.270
when she learns the truth.

13:59.270 --> 13:59.980
Be quiet.

14:10.850 --> 14:11.800
Hello.

14:12.090 --> 14:14.750
I’m Xia Han
from the Department of String Music.

14:15.270 --> 14:16.270
My name is Chen Fan.

14:16.270 --> 14:17.920
But I don't go to this university.

14:17.920 --> 14:18.840
It's not a problem.

14:18.840 --> 14:21.080
My friends and I are going to karaoke
this week.

14:21.080 --> 14:22.940
Will you join us, if you have time?

14:24.600 --> 14:26.000
Sorry, I'll be occupied.

14:26.390 --> 14:27.320
It's okay.

14:27.320 --> 14:28.440
Let's exchange contacts

14:28.440 --> 14:30.370
and meet up when you're available.

14:33.910 --> 14:34.670
Excuse me.

14:38.850 --> 14:40.260
Shall we dance?

14:41.840 --> 14:42.270
Sure.

15:18.790 --> 15:20.190
Are you looking for Shan?

15:21.250 --> 15:23.320
He disappeared after a dance.

15:26.080 --> 15:26.750
It seems...

15:27.200 --> 15:28.000
he has indeed

15:28.260 --> 15:30.350
been out of sight since that dance.

15:43.030 --> 15:43.720
Chen!

15:47.080 --> 15:48.140
What's up, Xiaole?

15:48.440 --> 15:49.480
This is my high school classmate.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.540
I'm Qiao Mengmeng!

15:51.600 --> 15:52.550
Her name is Qiao Mengmeng.

15:52.550 --> 15:54.610
This is her first visit to our campus.

15:54.790 --> 15:57.200
He's senior to me
in the Department of Photography,

15:57.200 --> 15:58.130
named Chen Chen.

15:58.960 --> 16:00.090
Hello, Senior Chen.

16:00.270 --> 16:00.670
Hello.

16:01.670 --> 16:04.600
Why don't you... give her a tour?

16:06.080 --> 16:07.670
Sure, of course.

16:07.910 --> 16:08.550
Lan,

16:09.000 --> 16:11.330
I'd rather stay out of this dancing stuff.

16:11.670 --> 16:12.600
You two have fun.

16:13.510 --> 16:14.080
Bye.

16:21.790 --> 16:23.790
What's your hobby, Senior?

16:24.200 --> 16:24.550
I...

16:24.840 --> 16:26.390
just enjoy taking photos.

16:27.240 --> 16:28.030
I see.

16:34.320 --> 16:36.320
It seems we've been left alone

16:36.320 --> 16:38.200
on this lovely dance night.

16:42.790 --> 16:43.440
Well...

16:44.080 --> 16:45.410
Will you do me the honor?

16:46.720 --> 16:47.320
Sure.

16:53.320 --> 16:54.180
The other hand.

16:55.720 --> 16:56.200
Oh.

17:06.550 --> 17:07.079
Spill it.

17:07.310 --> 17:08.240
What do you want?

17:09.310 --> 17:11.910
You know I attend this event every year,
right?

17:14.310 --> 17:15.200
Don't get me wrong.

17:15.200 --> 17:16.440
Today, I came here only to h-help

17:16.440 --> 17:17.109
Yi Lan.

17:18.960 --> 17:20.890
Still as straightforward as ever.

17:21.960 --> 17:24.560
I've just learned
how to communicate with you.

17:26.500 --> 17:27.099
Hey, wait.

17:28.200 --> 17:29.960
Has your dream come true?

17:33.440 --> 17:35.300
It's none of your business, is it?

17:41.030 --> 17:41.400
W-What

17:41.400 --> 17:42.920
is your hobby then?

17:43.030 --> 17:43.960
Me?

17:44.510 --> 17:48.030
I enjoy taking a walk and watching movies.

17:48.030 --> 17:49.560
Sometimes I come visit Lan.

17:50.510 --> 17:51.440
But as you know,

17:51.440 --> 17:53.200
watching movies alone is boring.

17:53.200 --> 17:55.660
We can go to the cinema together
if possible.

17:55.750 --> 17:56.270
Sure.

17:59.200 --> 18:00.200
Thank you for coming today.

18:00.200 --> 18:01.200
I've had much fun.

18:03.110 --> 18:04.110
Don't mention it.

18:04.480 --> 18:05.160
Our schools

18:05.720 --> 18:07.270
are close anyway.

18:07.750 --> 18:08.550
In the future,

18:08.920 --> 18:10.000
I can be with you

18:10.160 --> 18:11.020
for breakfast,

18:11.400 --> 18:12.110
lunch,

18:12.640 --> 18:13.350
dinner,

18:13.720 --> 18:15.320
and even late-night snacks.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.680
However...

18:17.680 --> 18:19.410
I may have to bail on breakfast,

18:20.680 --> 18:22.940
since I can't get up early in the morning.

18:27.960 --> 18:29.220
Join me for lunch then.

18:29.270 --> 18:31.270
I might be busy at night.

18:34.200 --> 18:34.590
Okay.

18:35.400 --> 18:36.270
Then...

18:38.640 --> 18:39.960
See you tomorrow at noon.

18:39.960 --> 18:40.290
Sure.

19:01.680 --> 19:03.270
When did you learn to dance?

19:03.750 --> 19:05.350
I get the hang

19:05.960 --> 19:07.920
of everything after a mere glance.

19:08.200 --> 19:09.270
Cut it out!

19:11.350 --> 19:11.810
Senior,

19:12.480 --> 19:14.140
take photos of Xiaole and Lan.

19:19.750 --> 19:20.810
Don't you think...

19:21.110 --> 19:22.510
they are a perfect match?

19:22.640 --> 19:23.440
I do think so.

19:55.030 --> 19:58.810
[Campus Photo Contest]

19:55.200 --> 19:57.350
This year's photo contest is approaching.

19:57.350 --> 19:58.350
Will you go for it?

20:02.110 --> 20:03.000
Is it true that you have

20:03.000 --> 20:05.730
a social media account
with a million followers?

20:06.830 --> 20:07.880
It's just a rumor,

20:07.880 --> 20:08.880
an exaggeration.

20:10.720 --> 20:12.160
Impressive.

20:12.720 --> 20:13.720
Now I get it.

20:14.510 --> 20:16.680
No wonder many girls are joining
the photography club lately.

20:16.680 --> 20:18.010
I bet they all aim at you.

20:31.160 --> 20:31.890
You like her?

20:33.640 --> 20:34.370
Give it to me.

20:49.350 --> 20:49.920
Lan.

20:51.480 --> 20:52.640
What's on your mind?

20:55.240 --> 20:55.960
Xiaoyi.

20:55.960 --> 20:56.350
Yes?

20:56.350 --> 20:57.350
I have a question.

20:58.270 --> 20:59.270
How...

20:59.270 --> 21:01.480
did you feel when you fell in love

21:01.480 --> 21:02.680
with your boyfriend?

21:04.920 --> 21:06.240
I felt...

21:06.270 --> 21:08.960
that my heart was beating fast.

21:09.920 --> 21:11.920
You'll know it when you fall in love.

21:16.160 --> 21:17.880
Well, I need to go on a date.

21:18.440 --> 21:19.920
My boyfriend is waiting for me.

21:19.920 --> 21:21.450
Aren't you leaving with me?

21:22.270 --> 21:23.400
He's right over there.

21:23.400 --> 21:23.880
Bye bye!

21:24.440 --> 21:24.900
See you.

21:28.680 --> 21:31.240
The heart beats fast...

21:40.480 --> 21:41.000
Lan!

21:42.200 --> 21:43.160
What are you doing here?

21:43.160 --> 21:45.160
Why are you here, Shan?

21:45.350 --> 21:45.920
I...

21:46.000 --> 21:47.660
was delivering an accessory.

21:47.880 --> 21:48.400
Shan.

21:49.030 --> 21:50.960
Where did you go during the freshman dance
yesterday?

21:50.960 --> 21:52.420
I couldn't find you at all.

21:52.830 --> 21:54.590
I left early for an emergency

21:54.680 --> 21:55.590
before I could tell you.

21:55.590 --> 21:55.990
Got it.

21:57.400 --> 21:58.930
You don't have an umbrella?

21:59.160 --> 22:00.480
Let me walk you back to your dorm.

22:00.480 --> 22:00.880
Okay.

22:00.900 --> 22:01.440
Let's go.

22:12.070 --> 22:12.870
Come on, move.

22:33.160 --> 22:34.960
Your Mr. Right has appeared.

22:36.200 --> 22:37.480
He's someone near you.

22:52.480 --> 22:54.640
What are your plans for the weekend?

22:55.000 --> 22:55.830
Dates?

22:56.160 --> 22:59.510
Of course. Such a lovely weekend
should be spent outside.

23:01.310 --> 23:03.970
Why don't you go out
with your boyfriend Xiaole?

23:04.000 --> 23:04.960
Let me say this again:

23:04.960 --> 23:06.270
Xiaole is not my boyfriend.

23:06.270 --> 23:07.730
He's my childhood friend.

23:07.880 --> 23:09.140
I'm not seeing anyone.

23:13.680 --> 23:14.410
I'm leaving.

23:14.440 --> 23:15.130
-Bye.
-Bye.

23:15.150 --> 23:15.920
Bye bye.

23:22.370 --> 23:25.740
[Millionaires-to-be]

23:24.000 --> 23:25.270
Any plans, guys?

23:25.400 --> 23:27.260
Shall we hang out this afternoon?

23:30.640 --> 23:34.510
Today marks the beginning of the romance
between me and Chen.

23:35.000 --> 23:36.400
You have a boyfriend now?

23:37.960 --> 23:39.350
That's really fast.

23:40.510 --> 23:41.880
We're on a date.

23:49.350 --> 23:59.150
[Humph, sickeningly sweet]

23:49.720 --> 23:51.070
Sickeningly sweet.

24:14.110 --> 24:14.720
Let's go.

24:20.160 --> 24:23.160
Are you going to meet Shan in this dress?

24:23.920 --> 24:24.720
What's wrong?

24:25.200 --> 24:25.930
It's pretty.

24:30.680 --> 24:31.850
As your friend,

24:31.870 --> 24:33.950
I feel obligated to suggest you

24:34.510 --> 24:35.790
wear something else.

24:36.030 --> 24:37.640
Or you might scare Shan.

24:40.920 --> 24:42.450
It's none of your business!

24:46.830 --> 24:48.510
I already offered my advice!

24:54.440 --> 24:55.000
Shan.

24:55.590 --> 24:56.050
You're here.

24:56.050 --> 24:56.440
Yes.

24:57.260 --> 24:57.890
So am I.

24:59.350 --> 25:00.480
Don't you feel cold?

25:00.790 --> 25:01.390
Not at all.

25:02.440 --> 25:02.830
Okay.

25:42.440 --> 25:43.200
What now?

26:02.110 --> 26:03.240
What are you trying to do, Tong Xiaole?

26:03.240 --> 26:04.820
You have a death wish or what?

26:04.820 --> 26:06.510
Didn't you say you wanted to study here?

26:06.510 --> 26:07.220
Step aside!

26:07.390 --> 26:08.120
Not a chance.

26:11.590 --> 26:12.240
Lan!

26:12.960 --> 26:13.590
What is it?

26:13.880 --> 26:15.200
I'd like to give you something.

26:15.200 --> 26:16.060
Do it here then.

26:16.440 --> 26:18.830
The thing's over there.
Come get it with me.

26:18.830 --> 26:19.880
You go get it yourself.

26:19.880 --> 26:20.920
It's too heavy to be carried alone.

26:20.920 --> 26:21.960
-Help me with it.
-I'm sure you can manage.

26:21.960 --> 26:22.400
Just come help...

26:22.400 --> 26:23.460
What are you doing?

26:26.030 --> 26:26.720
Well,

26:27.200 --> 26:28.680
the AC is on.

26:29.160 --> 26:30.200
Take this blanket.

26:30.200 --> 26:31.260
Don't catch a cold.

26:32.110 --> 26:32.480
Okay.

26:33.640 --> 26:35.500
There's water. Help yourselves.

26:59.270 --> 26:59.880
Lan,

27:00.270 --> 27:01.680
don't you always want to read this issue?

27:00.350 --> 27:03.760
[Comic Party]

27:01.960 --> 27:02.760
Who said that?

27:03.440 --> 27:04.100
Get it away!

27:08.240 --> 27:08.680
Shan,

27:08.680 --> 27:09.200
it's her fault.

27:09.200 --> 27:09.830
No, his fault.

27:09.830 --> 27:10.400
Her fault.

27:10.400 --> 27:11.060
Your fault!

27:14.510 --> 27:15.240
Sorry, Shan.

27:15.360 --> 27:16.110
How about this?

27:16.110 --> 27:18.270
Let's go buy ice cream for Shan
as an apology.

27:18.270 --> 27:19.270
My idea's better.

27:19.270 --> 27:22.270
Why don't you go buy ice cream
for us both as an apology?

27:23.510 --> 27:25.200
If any instruments break down
at your school,

27:25.200 --> 27:27.130
a repair guy will be needed, right?

27:27.200 --> 27:29.400
Several students have indeed asked for

27:29.400 --> 27:31.130
some shared cellos to be fixed.

27:31.240 --> 27:31.880
Then I...

27:33.330 --> 27:35.260
I can offer discounts for that.

27:35.830 --> 27:36.830
I'll ask the school about it.

27:36.830 --> 27:37.030
O-Okay.

27:37.030 --> 27:37.560
Go ahead.

27:45.270 --> 27:45.720
Lan,

27:46.200 --> 27:47.960
I remember
that teacher of your department...

27:47.960 --> 27:50.560
Professor Ye, has been single forever,
right?

27:50.680 --> 27:51.510
You mean Professor Ye Mei?

27:51.510 --> 27:51.910
Yes.

27:52.200 --> 27:54.060
She's a dedicated bachelorette.

27:56.200 --> 27:58.270
I see. So she won't get married.

27:58.700 --> 28:01.030
No wonder she has achieved so many things.

28:02.200 --> 28:02.750
Nothing happened.

28:02.750 --> 28:03.150
You...

28:03.240 --> 28:03.440
g-go on

28:03.440 --> 28:03.750
with

28:03.830 --> 28:04.360
the talk.

28:06.030 --> 28:06.610
Lan,

28:06.960 --> 28:08.960
didn't you say you'd practice the cello
today?

28:08.960 --> 28:10.440
That can wait.

28:10.720 --> 28:11.800
What if you fail the tryout

28:11.800 --> 28:13.920
and can't attend
Professor Ye Mei's lectures?

28:13.920 --> 28:15.050
You needs practice.

28:16.350 --> 28:17.350
Xiaole is right.

28:17.750 --> 28:18.720
Don't come here tomorrow.

28:18.720 --> 28:19.960
Focus on the cello practice.

28:19.960 --> 28:21.480
No, I can still come here, Shan.

28:21.480 --> 28:23.440
You should prioritize your practice.

28:23.440 --> 28:23.900
Xiaole!

28:25.480 --> 28:26.480
Keep watch on her.

28:28.590 --> 28:29.120
Let's go.

28:30.350 --> 28:30.680
Move.

28:36.110 --> 28:38.030
Next, Candidate No. 6.

28:38.440 --> 28:41.110
Candidate No. 7, please get ready.

28:48.440 --> 28:49.920
Are you okay?

28:50.350 --> 28:51.350
I need to go to...

28:52.110 --> 28:53.160
the infirmary.

28:53.200 --> 28:54.060
The infirmary?

28:54.750 --> 28:56.150
Is your stomach hurting?

28:57.920 --> 28:58.480
Ning,

28:59.110 --> 29:00.840
I'll take her to the infirmary.

29:01.680 --> 29:02.880
It'll be my turn soon.

29:02.960 --> 29:04.440
And you're right behind me.

29:04.440 --> 29:05.440
I'll be back soon.

29:06.240 --> 29:07.900
Make it in time for the tryout!

29:10.000 --> 29:11.770
Next, Candidate No. 7.

29:11.960 --> 29:14.640
Candidate No. 8, please get ready.

29:22.510 --> 29:23.680
What took you so long?

29:23.680 --> 29:24.740
The tryout is over.

29:25.440 --> 29:26.270
It's over?

29:26.480 --> 29:27.000
Yes.

29:27.480 --> 29:29.000
That girl is a stranger to you.

29:29.000 --> 29:30.200
But she was in agony

29:30.370 --> 29:31.970
for acute gastroenteritis.

29:33.480 --> 29:34.030
Fine.

29:34.680 --> 29:35.960
I'm off to my part-time job.

29:35.960 --> 29:36.350
Okay.

29:47.680 --> 29:48.680
Professor Ye.

29:49.590 --> 29:51.880
Late comers
are automatically disqualified.

29:51.880 --> 29:53.260
I told you guys before.

29:54.030 --> 29:55.830
Can I attend next year's tryout?

29:57.960 --> 30:00.290
Then you'll have a slim chance of passing.

30:04.360 --> 30:06.020
Why do you want to learn cello?

30:08.750 --> 30:09.910
It's a way...

30:10.680 --> 30:11.480
for me to feel,

30:12.110 --> 30:13.570
to have joy, and to express

30:14.110 --> 30:14.960
my thoughts.

30:16.890 --> 30:18.960
Not for the admission to a top orchestra

30:18.960 --> 30:20.690
and a chance to get on the stage?

30:22.960 --> 30:24.560
Of course I want all that too.

30:24.680 --> 30:26.410
I would love to have more people

30:26.510 --> 30:27.590
hear my music.

30:29.240 --> 30:32.720
You actually excel in expressing emotions
through music.

30:33.440 --> 30:35.110
But your basic skills are poor.

30:35.110 --> 30:36.960
Have more practice in that regard.

30:36.960 --> 30:37.690
Understood?

30:38.000 --> 30:38.440
Yes.

30:38.590 --> 30:39.990
Thank you, Professor Ye.

30:40.160 --> 30:41.160
I'm leaving then.

31:12.880 --> 31:14.880
You're tired from running a few steps?

31:14.880 --> 31:17.200
You've neglected your 5k running training
due to the cello practice, right?

31:17.200 --> 31:18.010
Listen,

31:18.110 --> 31:20.120
I was really happy today.

31:20.240 --> 31:21.750
Professor Ye gave me a praise

31:21.750 --> 31:24.550
just when I thought
I'd never have a second chance.

31:24.770 --> 31:26.960
You're so cheerful
though you failed the tryout.

31:26.960 --> 31:28.350
I can attend it next year.

31:28.350 --> 31:30.000
At least now I know I have a shot.

31:30.000 --> 31:32.530
As a reward to myself,
I'll rest for a few days.

31:33.960 --> 31:35.200
Have you...

31:36.570 --> 31:37.780
met with Shan lately?

31:38.680 --> 31:39.110
Yes.

31:39.350 --> 31:41.110
Just the other day
he delivered an accessory here,

31:41.110 --> 31:42.160
I ran into him.

31:42.480 --> 31:43.610
Then what happened?

31:43.880 --> 31:44.680
Well, then...

31:49.680 --> 31:50.240
Hey,

31:50.680 --> 31:52.010
can I ask you a question?

31:54.240 --> 31:56.920
How did you realize

31:58.030 --> 32:00.030
you fell in love with that girl?

32:00.720 --> 32:01.650
What do you mean?

32:02.150 --> 32:02.530
Well,

32:03.000 --> 32:04.240
I'm wondering if your heart

32:04.240 --> 32:04.880
also

32:04.960 --> 32:07.160
pounded like crazy.

32:08.110 --> 32:08.640
"Also"?

32:12.680 --> 32:14.540
Do you have a crush on someone now?

32:16.350 --> 32:17.030
Well...

32:17.680 --> 32:19.610
Just a little situation in my life.

32:24.160 --> 32:25.200
Stop prying!
